{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309590","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309590","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130959001:1":{"text":"하하, 어떤 의미에서 보면 보물 찾으러 온 게 맞기는 하죠.","source_cn":"哈哈，这说法有意思。从某种意义上讲，我们的确是来寻宝的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3360B0C6E6A1F353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130959002:1":{"text":"하지만 저희가 찾으려는 보물은 다른 사람들과는 달라요. 저희는 이미 사라져 버린 신비롭고 매력적인 역사를 찾아왔어요!","source_cn":"不过我们想找的宝藏和其他人不一样。那些神秘又迷人的失落...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E7A82D56AC500E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130959003:1":{"text":"이번엔 무언가를 좀 찾아서 석양의 신에 대한 논문을 완성할 수 있었으면 좋을 텐데!","source_cn":"真希望这次能找到点什么，最好能让我们完成一篇关于残阳神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27D5570859B08179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:学者朱利安":{"text":"학자 줄리안","source":"学者朱利安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}